<human_speech><green>Four fortresses, each covering the next. There is no seam. Do not grind it.<\green><blue>There is a teleporter in the south-west corner. Ships its owner sends away from it arrive at once, no flight time.<\blue><green>The shipyard behind the wall is soft. One landing takes it.<\green><blue>The wall is a picture of the enemy, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>. The enemy is behind it.<\blue><\human_speech>
